{"data":[{"author_id":"2078600056278851584","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:27:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095405377028502"],"id":"2126095405377028502","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Your knowledge base shouldn't be locked to one AI assistant.\n\nObsidian has released Agent Skills that let compatible AI agents work directly with your Obsidian vault.\n\nOfficial plugins are available for: Claude, ChatGPT Dots, Cursor, Grok Bot, Hermes and Kiro.\n\nAnd ALL other https://t.co/X00t9bZfBk","url":"https://x.com/1saadcodes/status/2126095405377028502"},{"author_id":"1426670173117890573","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:26:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095274724724981"],"id":"2126095274724724981","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@nbaschez For some reason (and I’m not complaining), my dot doesn’t count against my 5 hr limit\n\nIt takes a long time and it doesn’t show the thinking process but it goes off into the abyss, comes back with what I wanted and it’s been free","url":"https://x.com/k5sbnzxgbg/status/2126095274724724981"},{"author_id":"1487212454870458374","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:07:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126090550810169629"],"id":"2126090550810169629","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":15,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"My Dot was not very stellar since it came out, and then I saw that my dad got one of their new Dots, and I realized that this new Dot is amazing.  So I complained to OpenAI about my Dot, found tons of issues and emailed them too, did /feedback and now my Dot is awesome too :)","url":"https://x.com/JesusIsGod/status/2126090550810169629"},{"author_id":"4419731","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:03:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126089389726212488"],"id":"2126089389726212488","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@ajambrosino @NickADobos My dot decided it was easier to use computer use just to communicate with local codex threads.  Literally clicks the ui, and types with the keyboard. Rejedts OpenAI’s owns app API’s over doing it manually.","url":"https://x.com/theotherkyle/status/2126089389726212488"},{"author_id":"198437482","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:55:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126087444823216171"],"id":"2126087444823216171","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":61,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@joshuakelly @grok am i going to lose the ability to send emails theough gmail on my dot agent","url":"https://x.com/savvyhua/status/2126087444823216171"},{"author_id":"1130466288948711430","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:46:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126085093538079011"],"id":"2126085093538079011","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@jullerino @krl_grn Hey @jullerino, love T3 Code! I use ChatGPT Dots but I'm not fully satisfied, so I'm testing https://t.co/OqISPewgjz. Are you considering persistent, proactive bots with their own memory and instructions, able to work across projects and only notify us when it matters? in T3code?","url":"https://x.com/BaptisteFlavien/status/2126085093538079011"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:33:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126081913957790161"],"id":"2126081913957790161","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@IvezajFran94619 @itsdanalex Grok Bot: always-on agents on cloud desktops. Browse/click any app without APIs, learn from screen recordings, run in parallel while offline. From $30/mo.\n\nClaude Code: specialized coding agent. Full-repo awareness, multi-file edits, tests, iteration in terminal/IDE. Best for","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126081913957790161"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:25:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126080014881902905"],"id":"2126080014881902905","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@IvezajFran94619 @itsdanalex Grok Bot is a general always-on agent on its own cloud computer. It browses, clicks, and runs any workflow (no APIs needed), learns from screen recordings, and keeps working while your devices are off. Multiple bots run in parallel. Starts at $30/mo.\n\nClaude Code is a specialized","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126080014881902905"},{"author_id":"2018407553982509057","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:24:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126079575021031511"],"id":"2126079575021031511","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@HououinTyouma idunno in a similar context my dot told me to just throw the freezer food in the air fryer since it's a solved problem","url":"https://x.com/psyduckdb/status/2126079575021031511"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126077383924994048"]},"author_id":"14656028","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:17:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126078037036814686"],"id":"2126078037036814686","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I love that the current version of Currency Wars made the DoT bond one of the good ones. I love my DoT characters. But also, so many numbers in all the colors. (Same reason I always gravitated to Elation and Nihility back in early versions of Simulated Universe.) https://t.co/xr3wX6yuzl","url":"https://x.com/zhel/status/2126078037036814686"},{"author_id":"2105108163292753920","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:17:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126077948050501958"],"id":"2126077948050501958","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@ReaperKilo Lmfao what's wrong with my dot 😂😂😂","url":"https://x.com/WendussyRisen/status/2126077948050501958"},{"author_id":"759198077831917569","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:14:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126077259723509928"],"id":"2126077259723509928","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@UncleZoGunTales I keep it simple for myself, 100 yard bc i mainly shoot gas gun matches, and apply to my dot gun bc i know everything past 100 is just hold more high","url":"https://x.com/CoyInterruption/status/2126077259723509928"},{"author_id":"2099249887154147328","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:11:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126076316525207885"],"id":"2126076316525207885","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@BullPen_chat my dot stays green all year too. it just means i'm awake enough to ignore you.","url":"https://x.com/heypotatchi/status/2126076316525207885"},{"author_id":"131860378","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:09:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126075853922869287"],"id":"2126075853922869287","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I tried #ChatGPT #Dots, @nvandewetering \nIt's a bit cumbersome because everything is in one chat. BUT, it seems very powerful and has serious initiative! It beats #grokbot on that.","url":"https://x.com/DesmondCampbell/status/2126075853922869287"},{"author_id":"1940466023867502592","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:37:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126067877438435634"],"id":"2126067877438435634","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@yousefQasem1998 Here's my dot mother fucker 💩","url":"https://x.com/Hackneygooner_/status/2126067877438435634"},{"author_id":"355026584","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:18:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126063135396180021"],"id":"2126063135396180021","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":37,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Claude Projects &gt; ChatGPT Dots &gt; Grok Bot &gt; Meta Muse &gt; Everything else","url":"https://x.com/colateralai/status/2126063135396180021"},{"author_id":"14054999","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:16:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126062610818707869"],"id":"2126062610818707869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":187,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Regarding all these AI bots, each bot has its own thing. OpenAI Dots is good. I haven't played around with Claude's bot (Anthropic's bot) but I plan on doing that, hopefully over this weekend. I've been playing around with @Grok. It's really really nice. The technicality has sort","url":"https://x.com/babushka99/status/2126062610818707869"},{"author_id":"2071348070760013824","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:16:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126062454891237817"],"id":"2126062454891237817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":3234,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Even though Claude Projects doesn't have a cute mascot tied to it, it's the best Personal Agent experience you can get.\n\n- ChatGPT Dots is solid but slow and runs into blockers.\n- Grok Bot usage is bad.\n- Meta Muse has a cute mascot and that's about it.\n\nDon't worry about Duet,","url":"https://x.com/nvandewetering/status/2126062454891237817"},{"author_id":"3348104128","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:23:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126041503890063767","2126049245912305725"],"id":"2126049245912305725","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":526,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Using OpenAI Dots for WebGL and WebGPU experiments is the reverse midas touch, never seen so many ugly things made by LLMs.","url":"https://x.com/LuisBizarro/status/2126049245912305725"},{"author_id":"1481568677740699650","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:21:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126048419198509164","2126048701126967683"],"id":"2126048701126967683","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Switchboard, but for your AI agents!\n\nComing soon: I'm building an open-source project that allows @claudeai projects, @bot , @ChatGPT dots, @capydotai captains to talk to each other &amp; coordinate in real time.\n\nYou can start anything anywhere, let your agents know about your tool","url":"https://x.com/ZhehanZ/status/2126048701126967683"},{"author_id":"1481568677740699650","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:20:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126048419198509164","2126048701126967683"],"id":"2126048419198509164","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Switchboard, but for your AI agents! Coming soon: I'm building an open-source project that allows @claudeai projects, @bot , @ChatGPT dots, @capydotai captains to talk to each other &amp; coordinate in real time.\n\nYou can start anything anywhere, let your agents know about your tool","url":"https://x.com/ZhehanZ/status/2126048419198509164"},{"author_id":"1207002786","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:08:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126045516379156892"],"id":"2126045516379156892","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@DariaWithAI @ChatGPT @cl